{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Euclid's Inferno is a fast-paced 2D shooter where math is your enemy. Play as the father of geometry, explore a hellish version of the works of ancient mathematicians, and defeat polygonal beasts as you upgrade your geometric arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940860/extras/gif-main.gif?t=1741503303\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Euclid has found himself trapped in a demonic version of his magnum opus <i>The Elements</i> and must traverse the 2D plane and fight against hordes of mathematical constructs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mathematically Accurate Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940860/extras/gif-demon.gif?t=1741503303\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies and bosses inspired in the fundamentals of geometry and the works of past polymaths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade your Tool set</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940860/extras/gif-tools.gif?t=1741503303\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up new weapons and abilities as you venture deeper into the abstract realms of geometry and arithmetic. Launch points, cast rays and trace circles to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940860/extras/gif-editor.gif?t=1741503303\" />Become the geometer of your own worlds with the custom level editor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940860?t=1741503303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2